          "items": [
            "Summary:<br>Just minutes from the sand in Inlet Beach, this 3-story 30A retreat features 4 bedrooms, a bunk room with en-suite, and 4 baths across 2,196 sq. ft. Enjoy multiple outdoor spaces including a balcony, deck with Weber grill, and patio. Relax with smart TVs, a full kitchen, and laundry. Community pool and bikes make it easy to explore 30A, while private garage and driveway parking for 4 cars add rare convenience near the beach.<br><br>The Space:<br>Location perks: Inlet Beach public beach access (0.6 miles), 30Avenue shopping & dining (1.2 miles), Rosemary Beach (1.4 miles), Camp Helen State Park (3.2 miles)<br><br>Floor configuration<br>Main floor: Kitchen, dining area, living room, 1 bedroom (king bed), 1 full bathroom<br>Upper floor: 2 bedrooms (king beds), 1 en-suite bathroom, 1 full bathroom<br>Lower floor: 1 bedroom (triple twin bunks) plus connected den with couch, 1 en-suite full bathroom<br><br>Interior<br>— Kitchen (drip coffee maker, toaster oven, blender, cooking utensils, tableware)<br>— Smart TVs with streaming (bedrooms and living room)<br>— Central heat and A/C<br>— In-unit washer and dryer<br>— Free WiFi<br>— Square footage (2,196 sq. ft.)<br><br>Exterior<br>— Gas grill (Weber)<br>— Deck and patio<br>— Balcony<br>— On-site parking for 3 cars (1 in garage, 2 in driveway)<br>— Shared outdoor pool (community)<br>— Bikes (4)<br>— Golf Cart (1)<br><br>Guest Access:<br>Guests have full access to the entire home, garage and driveway parking, private patio/deck/balcony areas, in-unit laundry, and the Weber grill. The community outdoor pool is shared with neighbors. Bikes are provided for guest use.<br><br>The Neighborhood:<br>Set on a residential street in Inlet Beach along Florida’s 30A, the vibe is relaxed and coastal. Days tend to center around the beach, pool time, and easy bike rides, with evenings best for grilling on the deck or unwinding on the balcony.<br><br>Seasonally, guests enjoy swimming, paddling, fishing, and cycling. Nearby dining and shopping hubs are a short drive away, and the area is known for casual seafood, coffee spots, and beach boutiques.<br><br>Getting Around:<br>A car is recommended. On-site parking is available for 3 vehicles (1 garage, 2 driveway). There is no free bus or shuttle line noted for this location. Bikes are provided for local cruising. Rideshare services operate in the area, but public transit is limited.<br><br>Other Things to Note:<br>Please be sure to confirm proper beach access as some beaches are private and require a specific wristband.<br><br>Interaction with Guests:<br>We are offsite but available when needed. Please message us through the app or booking platform for the quickest response.",
